PlatformIO Test Directory
=========================

This directory contains automated unit tests executed via the PlatformIO Test Runner and Unity testing framework.

Structure
---------
test/
├── test_table_logic/
│   └── test_table_logic.cpp     # Unit tests for occupancy, RFID authorization, and auto-checkout timeout logic
└── test_command_handler/
    └── test_command_handler.cpp # Unit tests for socket command parsing and mode transitions

How to Run Tests
----------------
Execute the tests locally on your machine:

    pio test -e native

Or on Windows PowerShell (using the PlatformIO virtual environment):

    & "$env:USERPROFILE\.platformio\penv\Scripts\platformio.exe" test -e native

To run a specific test suite:

    pio test -e native -f test_table_logic
    pio test -e native -f test_command_handler

For more information, see:
https://docs.platformio.org/en/latest/advanced/unit-testing/index.html
